  "description": "Least-loaded node selection for SetNet clusters: an entry node keeps a registry of game nodes with reported load/capacity (fed from SetNet.Cluster gossip or an orchestrator via UpdateNode) and directs clients to the emptiest one. server.UseLoadBalancer() + client.UseLoadBalancer().PickAsync(). Pairs with SetNet.Sharding for key-driven routing. Depends only on SetNet.",
